# Template Learnings Rule

When working in an app repository that was created from this template:

- If you discover a reusable implementation pattern, document it in `docs/learnings.md`.
- Keep learnings separate from task tracking in `tasks/`.
- Each learning section should include:
  - Problem
  - Reusable Pattern
  - Risk and Rollout Notes
- To add a new learning, append a new `## Title` section at the end of the file following the existing format.
